<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ctitle</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>ctitle &lt;member&gt; &lt;title&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>ctitle fizban Master of the Under-dark
</pre>
<p>Gives a member of your clan a new title. The clan's tag is added at the 
end by itself. The clan Master and Lords can use ctitle, and so can members 
of rank 21 or higher; the member must be in the game.
</p><p>Each title costs the clan 10 platinum pieces, taken from the clan treasury 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Cdeposit</a>); if there isn't enough in it, no title is set.
</p><p>The rules for clan titles:
</p>
<ul><li>No other tags: the clan tag added by the game is the only one. Tags the game adds by itself, such as Guide or Builder, are the exception.</li>
<li>No special characters, and no title longer than one line.</li>
<li>Titles are in English, and in good taste: a vulgar, obscene or insulting title can get the clan disbanded.</li></ul>
<p>For example, "Herdas - Master of The Under-dark" followed by the clan tag 
is allowed; "Herdas - Seeker of The Under-dark * LORD *" is not.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Crank</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cdeposit</a>
